      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775144160146,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧱 Main Database\nOptions\n\nPostgreSQL (Neon /\nSupabase / Cloud SQL)\nMongoDB (Atlas)\nMySQL (PlanetScale /\nCloud SQL)\nFirebase Firestore\nDynamoDB (AWS)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧱 Main Database Options\n\nPostgreSQL (Neon / Supabase / Cloud SQL)\nMongoDB (Atlas)\nMySQL (PlanetScale / Cloud SQL)\nFirebase Firestore\nDynamoDB (AWS)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wikkFJfJnjQy0TLEiSDq7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2960.9110081739127,
      "y": 509.7972352611657,
      "width": 337.981395432569,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b02",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1139909888,
      "version": 99,
      "versionNonce": 364946688,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775144177938,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🧠 Vector DB (for RAG\n— you WILL need this)\n\nPinecone\nWeaviate\nSupabase Vector\n(pgvector)\nChroma (dev only\nmostly)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🧠 Vector DB (for RAG — you WILL need this)\n\nPinecone\nWeaviate\nSupabase Vector (pgvector)\nChroma (dev only mostly)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "skE57mMAJg0gkP912Jpxi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3368.718189719549,
      "y": 877.7210614928966,
      "width": 772.9253285880633,
      "height": 980,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1337558272,
      "version": 272,
      "versionNonce": 226323200,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775144685893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚔️ Quick Comparison (your use case: SaaS + chatbot +\nGCP RAG)\n\nPostgreSQL (Neon/Supabase) ✅ BEST\nStructured + scalable + supports pgvector (RAG)\nWorks for auth, billing, logs, chat history\nIndustry standard → best long-term choice\n\nMongoDB\nFlexible schema, easy start\n❌ Weak for complex queries + joins (you’ll need them\nlater)\n\nMySQL\nStable but less modern ecosystem vs Postgres\n\nFirestore\nReal-time + easy\n❌ Vendor lock-in, weak querying, costly at scale\n\nDynamoDB\nHigh scale\n❌ Overkill + complex for your stage\n\n🧠 Final Recommendation (for YOU)\nPrimary DB: PostgreSQL (Neon)\nVector DB: Start with pgvector (same DB) → upgrade\nto Pinecone later if needed",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚔️ Quick Comparison (your use case: SaaS + chatbot + GCP RAG)\n\nPostgreSQL (Neon/Supabase) ✅ BEST\nStructured + scalable + supports pgvector (RAG)\nWorks for auth, billing, logs, chat history\nIndustry standard → best long-term choice\n\nMongoDB\nFlexible schema, easy start\n❌ Weak for complex queries + joins (you’ll need them later)\n\nMySQL\nStable but less modern ecosystem vs Postgres\n\nFirestore\nReal-time + easy\n❌ Vendor lock-in, weak querying, costly at scale\n\nDynamoDB\nHigh scale\n❌ Overkill + complex for your stage\n\n🧠 Final Recommendation (for YOU)\nPrimary DB: PostgreSQL (Neon)\nVector DB: Start with pgvector (same DB) → upgrade to Pinecone later if needed",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
